				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dianaberry" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3444428); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3444428&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605795036" alt="DianaBerry" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3444428)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dianaberry" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3444428); return false;" >DianaBerry</a></span> <span class="odate time_1581744302 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">15 Feb 2020 05:25</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4501459">
									

<p>So it's been awhile since I posted a scip, eh? I guess it's just hard to find what works. This idea originally was something I had in the format of a parawatch tale, but <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5045819); return false;">Calibri Bold</a></span> confirmed that it didn't work in that format. So I changed up some things, and now here it is as an SCP!</p>
<p>This scip has my feelings in it in some places, so I guess it means a good bit to me</p>
<p>All art is done by me. All profile pictures used are either art pieces I did, or pictures I took. One is of my cat, one is of ice-cream I had one time. If you want to see the full images I'll show you, but they're mine lol.</p>
<p>Special thanks to my reviwers/betareaders:</p>
<ul>
<li><span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/malycegraves" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4916887); return false;">MalyceGraves</a></span>-Gave me the idea for the AWCY bit and final addendum, and with wording and flow in general.</li>
<li><span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mew-ltiverse" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5271378); return false;">Mew-ltiverse</a></span>-Helped me find the AWCY direction once the idea was pitched.</li>
<li><span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/bluejones" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4646198); return false;">BlueJones</a></span></li>
<li><span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/calibri-bold" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5045819); return false;">Calibri Bold</a></span></li>
<li>DrMoned</li>
<li><span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drferrum" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2067684); return false;">drferrum</a></span></li>
<li><span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-fullham" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1989312); return false;">Doctor Fullham</a></span></li>
</ul>
<p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/woedenaz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404096); return false;">Woedenaz</a></span> who made me the lost media wiki comment code, I owe you my life dude, and <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djkaktus" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1888434); return false;">djkaktus</a></span> who helped my dumb stubborn ass with formatting the last two images.</p>
<p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span> Hope y'all enjoyed! It only took like a week to whip up, but it also took some hard work and dedication. Until next time!~</p>
<p>Edit: If you’re on mobile, the images are gonna look weird. I’ll try to fix that tomorrow but I’m tired for tonight.</p>

